<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>Credit Score Update</title>
    <style>
        body {
            margin: 0;
            padding: 0;
            background-color: #f4f5f7;
            font-family: Arial, sans-serif;
            color: #333333;
        }
        .email-wrapper {
            max-width: 600px;
            margin: 0 auto;
            background-color: #ffffff;
            border-radius: 8px;
            overflow: hidden;
            box-shadow: 0 2px 8px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.05);
            margin-top: 20px;
            margin-bottom: 20px;
        }
        .email-header {
            background: linear-gradient(135deg, #0052cc 0%, #003399 100%);
            padding: 24px;
            text-align: center;
            color: #ffffff;
        }
        .logo {
            font-size: 24px;
            font-weight: bold;
            letter-spacing: 0.5px;
            background-color: #002266;
            display: inline-block;
            padding: 8px 16px;
            border-radius: 4px;
        }
        .email-body {
            padding: 32px 24px;
        }
        .greeting {
            font-size: 18px;
            font-weight: bold;
            margin-bottom: 12px;
        }
        .message {
            font-size: 15px;
            color: #555555;
            line-height: 1.5;
            margin-bottom: 24px;
        }
        .score-banner {
            background-color: #f0f4ff;
            border: 1px solid #d0e1fd;
            border-radius: 8px;
            padding: 20px;
            text-align: center;
            margin-bottom: 30px;
        }
        .btn-primary {
            display: inline-block;
            background-color: #0066ff;
            color: #ffffff;
            text-decoration: none;
            font-weight: bold;
            padding: 14px 28px;
            border-radius: 6px;
            font-size: 16px;
            box-shadow: 0 4px 12px rgba(0, 102, 255, 0.2);
        }
        .features-title {
            text-align: center;
            font-size: 18px;
            font-weight: bold;
            margin-bottom: 20px;
            color: #222222;
        }
        .feature-card {
            display: flex;
            align-items: flex-start;
            background-color: #fafbfd;
            border: 1px solid #eef2f7;
            padding: 16px;
            border-radius: 6px;
            margin-bottom: 12px;
        }
        .feature-icon {
            font-size: 24px;
            margin-right: 16px;
            min-width: 32px;
            text-align: center;
        }
        .feature-content h4 {
            margin: 0 0 4px 0;
            font-size: 15px;
            color: #222222;
        }
        .feature-content p {
            margin: 0;
            font-size: 13px;
            color: #666666;
            line-height: 1.4;
        }
        .email-footer {
            background-color: #f8fafc;
            padding: 24px;
            text-align: center;
            font-size: 12px;
            color: #777777;
            border-top: 1px solid #eeeeee;
        }
        .email-footer a {
            color: #0066ff;
            text-decoration: none;
        }
    </style>
</head>
<body>

    <div class="email-wrapper">
        <!-- Header -->
        <div class="email-header">
            <div class="logo">PAISABAZAAR</div>
        </div>

        <!-- Body Content -->
        <div class="email-body">
            <div class="greeting">Hi BIKASH,</div>
            <div class="message">
                Your updated Credit Report is here, check now to see what has changed in your credit score report.
            </div>

            <!-- Call to Action Banner -->
            <div class="score-banner">
                <p style="margin: 0 0 16px 0; font-size: 16px; font-weight: bold; color: #1a1a1a;">Here is a change in your Credit Report!</p>
                <a href="https://www.paisabazaar.com" class="btn-primary">Check Your Free Credit Score ›</a>
            </div>

            <!-- Features Section -->
            <div class="features-title">Why choose Paisabazaar?</div>

            <div class="feature-card">
                <div class="feature-icon">📋</div>
                <div class="feature-content">
                    <h4>Credit Report from All 4 Bureaus</h4>
                    <p>Get Credit Score and Report from CIBIL, Experian, Highmark and Equifax.</p>
                </div>
            </div>

            <div class="feature-card">
                <div class="feature-icon">📈</div>
                <div class="feature-content">
                    <h4>Free Monthly Credit Score Updates</h4>
                    <p>Track your Credit Score monthly and get personalized insights on your credit report.</p>
                </div>
            </div>

            <div class="feature-card">
                <div class="feature-icon">💡</div>
                <div class="feature-content">
                    <h4>Detailed Insights on your Credit Report</h4>
                    <p>Get actionable insights and fix errors in your report, if any.</p>
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>

        <!-- Footer -->
        <div class="email-footer">
            <p>If you have any questions or need assistance, reach out at <strong>1800-208-8877</strong> or <a href="mailto:care@paisabazaar.com">care@paisabazaar.com</a></p>
            <p><a href="https://www.paisabazaar.com">Click here to unsubscribe</a></p>
        </div>
    </div>

</body>
</html>
